@startuml fulfillment
!theme plain
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam defaultFontSize 17
skinparam defaultFontColor #17233B
skinparam sequenceArrowColor #416791
skinparam sequenceLifeLineBorderColor #CAD7E8
skinparam sequenceParticipantBorderColor #AFC5E2
skinparam sequenceParticipantBackgroundColor #EAF2FF
skinparam sequenceGroupBorderColor #B5C6DE
skinparam sequenceGroupBackgroundColor #F5F8FC
skinparam sequenceDividerBackgroundColor #E8F0FF
skinparam sequenceDividerBorderColor #B8CBE6
hide footbox
title Путь клиента  ·  2/2  Принятие → демо-выдача

actor "Клиент" as User
boundary "web" as Web #EAF2FF
participant "client-service" as Client #EAF2FF
queue "Kafka" as Kafka #FFF2D9
participant "bank-service" as Bank #EAF2FF

== Принятие оферты ==
User -> Web: Принять условия
Web -> Client: POST /offer/accept
Client -> Kafka: client.events\nOfferAccepted
Kafka -> Bank: Проверить offer_id
Bank -> Bank: OFFER_ACCEPTED
Bank -> Kafka: bank.events\nFORMALIZING
Kafka -> Client: Обновить проекцию

== Демо-подпись ==
Web -> Client: GET заявки (polling)
Client --> Web: FORMALIZING, offer_id
User -> Web: Подписать
Web -> Client: POST /sign
Client -> Kafka: client.events\nContractSigned
Kafka -> Bank: Подтвердить подпись

== Демо-выдача ==
Bank -> Bank: SIGNING → DISBURSED (worker)
Bank -> Kafka: bank.events\nDISBURSED
Kafka -> Client: Обновить проекцию
Web -> Client: GET заявки (polling)
Client --> Web: DISBURSED
Web --> User: Выдача симулирована
@enduml
